EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}Where have you guys been?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You didn't sneak off to get a snack
without me, did you?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}¿Dónde habéis estado?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Os habéis
ido a zamparos unos bocatas y
unos ganchitos sin mí, ¿a que sí?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}Mais où vous étiez ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Vous ne vous
êtes pas arrêtés en chemin pour
manger un bout sans moi au moins ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}Ma che fine avevate fatto?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Non vi sarete mica fatti
uno spuntino senza di me?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}Wo habt ihr nur gesteckt?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wart ihr
irgendwo {{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} essen,
ohne mir Bescheid zu sagen?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}Nerelerde kaldınız?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bensiz gizlice bir şeyler atıştırmaya
kaçmadınız, değil mi?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Mira que eres vago, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.
Ni siquiera eres capaz de venir a
buscarme.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bueno, ¿qué querías?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I wanted to return that thing
I borrowed from you.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}I figured I
should do it before I forget.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bueno,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} quería devolverte esa cosa
que me prestaste.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Mejor que lo
haga ahora, porque luego me olvido.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ecco,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} volevo ridarti quella cosa che
mi avevi prestato.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Così ho pensato
di farlo prima di dimenticarmene!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Şey,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} senden ödünç aldığım şeyi geri
vermek istedim.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Unutmadan
halledeyim dedim.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Whoa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} My {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Excellent! I didn't think I'd ever see
this again!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}'Cause lending stuff to you is
basically the same thing as throwing
it into a black hole.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Vay be!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Benim {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Harika! Bunu bir daha göreceğimi sanmıyordum!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Çünkü sana bir şey ödünç vermek, onu
kara deliğe atmakla aşağı
yukarı aynı şey.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Demek beni bunun için çağırdın!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Benden borç para isteyeceksin sanmıştım.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Neyse, sağ ol, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bir kereliğine de olsa senden istediğim
bir şeyi gerçekten yaptın.

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je viens de finir un livre super cool,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je voulais te le donner.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je crois que tu en auras besoin.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
C'est un livre de recettes rigolotes !
Il y a même tout un chapitre sur les
tartes à la crème !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho qui un libro che devi leggere
assolutamente, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Secondo me ti piacerebbe molto!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}È una raccolta di barzellette
sui poliziotti puliti!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I cosiddetti
"puliziotti"!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich hab da ein Buch, das du
unbedingt lesen musst, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und zwar das hier...
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}„{{TAG:0005:001D:0000}}“!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Da sind auch ein paar Comicseiten
mit drin! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Sogar in Farbe und alles!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Fermo lì!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Cosa stai insinuando?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Che ho bisogno di rinnovare il mio
repertorio di barzellette?!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Comunque sia, quel libro ce l'ho già.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Spesso lo uso come fonte di
ispirazione.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Se vuoi, a casa ho anche il seguito:
"Poliziotti e Monoziotti".{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Magari
te lo presto, così impari qualcosa!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} C'est affreux ! {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Il faut
que tu m'aides ! {{TAG:0007:0000:19000000}}Je n'ai plus de
sucre et le magasin est trop loin !
{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Tu peux m'en ramener ?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}De chez toi
ou du magasin, comme tu voudras,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
mais il faut que tu m'en ramènes !
Attends !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}} Mais OUI !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Que je suis
bête !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Il m'en reste dans mon lit !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Je n'ai qu'à secouer les draps et
j'en aurai assez pour ce soir. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Hé hé !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Je suis sauvé ! {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Tu iras demain alors.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Deswegen hast du mich herbestellt?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Manchmal frag ich mich echt, wie du
bis dato überlebt hast.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Hier ein Tipp:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wenn du dich das
nächste Mal mit {{TAG:0005:0010:0000}}
vollstopfst...
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}KAU gefälligst, bevor du {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0600690068006E000600730069006500040065007300}}
runterschlingst!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}Mann,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Mann,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Mann.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0029:}}Beni bunun için mi çağırdın?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sadece selam demek için?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}} Seni
